AI_ML_Tester

Software Architecture

1. User problems
    - Users want to see ML training and testing in real time environment visually
    - Users want to see neural network and training formula and how they work
    - Users want to see several different types of Perceptrons
2. Target users
    - Developers
    - Students who is learning AI/ML
3. Feature priorities
    - Register/Login
    - Choose any perceptron
    - Show neural network of chosen perceptron
    - Train neural network with default values or custom values
    - Test trained neural network with default values or custom 
    - Show trained values, desired outputs and real outputs
4. Data
    - users: id, fullname, email, hashedpassword, mfa
    - perceptrons: id, name, description, train_formula, weights, bias, user_id
